.env
.venv/
# Per-machine Claude Code state: local settings, the desktop app's
# launch.json, session worktrees
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# Google Drive's folder-icon metadata, in every folder the K:\ checkout
# syncs (docs/design/collaboration.md, "The K:\ drive is a mounted Google
# Drive letter"); the ones under .git are the deploy scripts' to delete
desktop.ini
board.png
# Everything printed, one subfolder per script (docs/design/cards.md,
# "Where printed output goes")
d12ball/print/
# ...and the Tethys deck's (scripts/render_tethys_deck.py)
tethysdeck/print/
# ...and where it used to go, so an old checkout's copies stay untracked
/print/
cards/
# ...which would also take the Codex card art, whose folder is named
# cards/ too: imported by scripts/import_codex_cards.py and committed
# (docs/design/codex.md, "The cards are data")
!codex/images/cards/
# The colours' card sheets, 15 to 20 MB each, kept out for the twelve
# worker cards cut from them, which are committed; fetched again by
# `import_codex_cards.py --fetch-sheet` to re-cut (the author,
# 2026-10-10; docs/design/codex.md, "The cards are data")
codex/images/board/sheets/black_card_sheet.png
